---
import WikiPage from '../components/WikiPage.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../data/images';
const cards = [
  { title: 'Stoves', description: 'Compare the Basic, Standard, and Deluxe cooking-station tiers.', href: '/equipment/stoves/', icon: 'S' },
  { title: 'Deluxe Stove', description: 'Read the focused database entry for the higher-tier stove.', href: '/equipment/deluxe-stove/', icon: 'D' },
  { title: 'Chiller', description: 'Review the Chiller and its repair options.', href: '/equipment/chiller/', icon: 'C' },
];
---
<WikiPage title="Equipment" seoTitle="Karinderya Equipment & Upgrade Guide | Karinderya Wiki" description="Browse Karinderya stoves, cooking equipment, upgrades, and the Chiller." kicker="Restaurant tools" intro="A practical reference for restaurant equipment and upgrades." cards={cards} sourceIds={['wiki-furniture', 'deluxe-guide', 'worker-chiller']} relatedLinks={[{ label: 'Stoves', href: '/equipment/stoves/' }, { label: 'Deluxe Stove', href: '/equipment/deluxe-stove/' }, { label: 'Chiller', href: '/equipment/chiller/' }]} heroImage={siteImages.equipmentHero} tableOfContents browseHeading="Equipment Categories" copyHeading="Equipment Overview">
  <p>Equipment supports cooking and other restaurant systems. Stoves provide cooking stations, while the Chiller belongs to a separate equipment feature with its own repair interactions.</p>

  <h2 id="upgrade-progression">Upgrade Progression</h2>
  <p>The stove order is <a href="/equipment/basic-stove/">Basic Stove</a>, <a href="/equipment/standard-stove/">Standard Stove</a>, then <a href="/equipment/deluxe-stove/">Deluxe Stove</a>. Higher tiers are described as reducing cooking time.</p>
  <p>Adding cooking stations also makes it possible to prepare more than one order in parallel. Use the individual stove pages to compare where each tier sits in the progression.</p>

  <h2 id="how-equipment-works">How Equipment Works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Stoves are used to cook customer orders.</li>
    <li>Basic, Standard, and Deluxe form the current stove progression.</li>
    <li>Better stove tiers reduce cooking time.</li>
    <li>A Deluxe Stove is included in the <code>2MVISITS</code> code reward.</li>
    <li>The Chiller has its own equipment page covering its repair interactions.</li>
  </ul>
</WikiPage>
